     1521   field cash-num      as integer
     1522   field cash-num-char as character
     1523   field port-num      as character
     1524   field way           as character
     1525   field is-script     as logical
     1526   field pswd          as character
     1527   field waiting-sek   as integer
     1528   field other-info    as character
     1529   field order-num     as integer
     1530   field secondary     as integer
     1531   field shift-fields  as integer
     1532   field binary        as logical
